    {
      "uid": "zhcn:966cf32e52b919600a14d10b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还记得以前我们更小的时候\n在胜利俱乐部办活动，\n那时我们从准备阶段就一直手忙脚乱的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff3e68b1cdab6d7c1534b23a951124d951c3baa8b8e2181c21bd8c47f3c0dc7e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
