    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e00386a873459e519712070",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以一知万，爆进式！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ecc82d13fc8f3034681627583e1f3a904b149ba7b26898e6fb8de65f829bbe4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041800.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b29e93fd3e6b03646a349630",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每年特雷森学园都会召开\n以小学生赛马娘为对象的\n“春季赛马娘交通安全教室”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f473894add1e0646e8457df6ed7d249ab20e8000aa7825091587cf5853f2da7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041801.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e17887ed926f8fc062bd571",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今年樱花进王等人被选为特别讲师，\n于是今天她们前来支援这场讲座，\n但是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4275f9e34fc0b56c0347b33c24c4f6581647755190033cf6f1a1153e5a7df0f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041801.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47122c26dd212a6a5b1fbc49",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花进王",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb83f0cfd91efed693a0e2da1635e6fbe976243d887008d948a31b60847aa357",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041801.json",
      "json_path": [
