    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0c2024f38662620c6a265c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然这样就换班长上场了！\n因为我一点都不紧张！！！\n就让我来为大家示范吧！哈哈哈！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f54b41d08d96a67dd478e9616d6ef18bfc4a6c80ccbd1b08608bec835e7f9bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041801.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ecab5425b6fceb616058457",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是讲座继续进行。\n我在一旁静观其变，想说过一段时间\n她们应该就不紧张了吧，但是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "161e3643c5858d483b53053fe6820cab086a32c8037bbb21de82e270742a6ad8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041801.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d8f0bc0015ee260c034d731",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花进王",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb83f0cfd91efed693a0e2da1635e6fbe976243d887008d948a31b60847aa357",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
